	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"&2&lThe Sieve.&r"
				""
				"You have a tree. That is the entire starting inventory - no buckets, no water, no lava, and the chest on your island is empty."
				""
				"&e&lEverything comes out of that tree, in this order:&r"
				"&7 1.&r Punch it. Planks, sticks, a crafting table."
				"&7 2.&r Make a &eCrook&r and break the &eleaves&r with it - that drops &esilk worms&r and far more saplings."
				"&7 3.&r Silk worms become &estring&r, and string becomes your first &eMesh&r."
				"&7 4.&r Put leaves in a &eBarrel&r or &eCrucible&r to get &bwater&r."
				"&7 5.&r Sieve &edirt&r with the string mesh for &estone pebbles&r. Four pebbles make cobblestone - that is where the first stone in this world comes from."
				"&7 6.&r Melt cobble in a &ePorcelain Crucible&r for &clava&r."
				"&7 7.&r &bWater&r + &clava&r = the cobble engine, and from there it never stops."
				""
				"&8Follow the line left to right. Nothing below is optional except the branches, which teach mesh upgrades and the two crystals that open every tech mod."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:oak_sapling"
			id: "2101000000000001"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 3
					id: "2101000000000101"
					item: "minecraft:oak_sapling"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					count: 8
					id: "2101000000000102"
					item: "minecraft:bone_meal"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.5d
			subtitle: "&7From nothing, everything"
			tasks: [{
				id: "2101000000000201"
				title: "Take flight"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "&2The Sieve"
			x: -16.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2101000000000013"]
			description: [
				"&e&lNow&r you can build it."
				""
				"Flowing &bwater&r hitting a &clava&r source makes cobblestone. Break it and it comes straight back, forever, for free."
				""
				"&7This is why the Crucible came first - lava does not exist in the void until you melt cobble into it. Bucket the lava out of your crucible, place it, run water over it, and you are done hand-making stone.&r"
				""
				"&8Everything downstream - gravel, sand, dust, every ore in the pack - begins as cobblestone. Build two or three of these."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:cobblestone"
			id: "2101000000000002"
			rewards: [{
				id: "2101000000000103"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 20
			}]
			subtitle: "&7Water + lava = infinite stone"
			tasks: [{
				count: 64L
				id: "2101000000000202"
				item: "minecraft:cobblestone"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "&aThe Cobble Engine"
			x: -12.0d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2101000000000017"]
			description: [
				"Craft a &eWooden Hammer&r and smash your cobble down the chain:"
				""
				"&7Cobblestone &8→&r Gravel &8→&r Sand &8→&r Dust&r"
				""
				"Each step is more sievable material. The hammer wears out - stone, iron and diamond hammers last far longer and you will want them soon."
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "exdeorum:wooden_hammer"
				tag: {
					Damage: 0
				}
			}
			id: "2101000000000003"
