		{
			dependencies: ["2101000000000008"]
			description: [
				"&bApplied Energistics starts here.&r Sift &esand&r (not gravel) with an iron mesh or better and &eCertus Quartz&r crystals drop."
				""
				"No meteors fall in the void, so this is your organic path into AE2. Bank a few crystals - The Kinetic Age turns them into a digital brain."
			]
