			description: [
				"&9Mekanism starts here.&r With an iron mesh, gravel also drops &eOsmium Ore Chunks&r. Smelt them into Osmium Ingots - the metal every Mekanism machine is built from."
				""
				"The keystone bridge in The Kinetic Age is faster, but you can bootstrap Mekanism from the sieve alone."
