				""
				"&c&lIt needs cobble first.&r Every lava recipe in Ex Deorum wants cobblestone, gravel, stone or netherrack, which is why First Cobble comes before this and the cobble engine comes after."
				""
				"&7The wooden crucible is a different block - it renders leaves into water. Both are worth having.&r"
				""
