		{
			dependencies: ["2101000000000016"]
			description: [
				"&eEx Machinis: Divitiae Deorum&r automates the exact chain you've been doing by hand - RF-powered &eFlux Sieve&r, &eFlux Hammer&r and &eFlux Compactor&r. Feed them power instead of your own clicks."
				""
				"&6&lThis is the most important quest in this chapter.&r Everything above this point scales with how long you are willing to hold right-click. Everything below it scales with how much power you can make. That is the whole difference between a skyblock and a factory."
				""
				"&e&lThe full automated line:&r"
				"&7Cobble generator &8→&7 Flux Hammer &8→&7 gravel &8→&7 Flux Sieve &8→&7 ore chunks &8→&7 furnace &8→&7 ingots&r"
				""
				"Each machine takes a mesh or a tool in its slot exactly like the hand version, so your diamond mesh carries straight over. They accept any Forge Energy - Powah reactors, Create Crafts & Additions alternators, Thermal dynamos, whatever you have running."
				""
				"&7Build the sieve first, the hammer second.&r Hammering is the less painful half by hand; sieving is what actually eats your evenings."
				""
				"&8Feed the output into a chest and walk away. Come back to stacks of chunks. From here The Kinetic Age is about spending them, not gathering them."
			]
